 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YkLA_Ix75oYQ7kNvwFXBmB4&_nc_oc=AdqoTSmOUsv92xKb5xYPnxnZEVtQCKfLAjRUitIDkYt1Dcpuao67EWtsTyzFcnGHt-o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM-ixzuZy8uB-m6W2qK2CidQcydq_K0IUGpGj4u5CwMYA&oe=6AD391C1"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FKl95go6wTsQ7kNvwELeFST&_nc_oc=AdrCDh0VCmvK2rKH09PchU4NZ_H2BzCZ9qvlJY423VGRmKN_fae3tsrV6kOr0-JK0Zg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMIV3vAabg3LW1YElhglMDsIPERMF_YaDQmtzZbCoZl-g&oe=6AD39F26"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BdYcNVQn-jIQ7kNvwFCzUzq&_nc_oc=AdqdGpXF4LAekQ3GmWU0b4YlYWau0FiJZbhIz_TgVH1b-FkWGRjM5htzMATDTnGJwZ4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM36cXQYuad2aFMZ5yl5-CouP0U6smRpP1p5HXSjQaaYA&oe=6AD3A91C"}, {"fil